# The build context is the repo root; keep it small and keep local state out of the image.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.git
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.env
apps/engine/facts
data/licensed/*
!data/licensed/README.md
data/raw/*.zip
